# Squad Manager for Kilroy Units
#
# This processor is a memory cell + lookup function to allow "Leader" units \
# to create Squads, request the addition of units to their squad, and send making their @unit data available to all squad members.
#
#

setRate 200

jump noRequest equal dataRequest 0

jump createSquad equal dataRequest 1

jump addToSquad equal dataRequest 2

jump appendToSquad equal dataRequest 3

jump returnSquadLeader equal dataRequest 4

noRequest:
end

createSquad:
op add newSquadId currMaxSquadId 1
